{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"front-group","type":"group","x":345,"y":65,"width":1455,"height":855,"color":"2","label":"STEREO COLUMN FRONTEND · planned assembly"},
		{"id":"left-row","type":"text","text":"## Left circular_row_buffer · RTL\n\nSerial left pixels → complete K-row vertical L[x].\n[[Circular Row Buffer]]","x":425,"y":155,"width":330,"height":245,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"right-row","type":"text","text":"## Right circular_row_buffer · same RTL\n\nSerial right pixels → complete K-row vertical R[x].\nSecond instance/wiring is planned.","x":425,"y":535,"width":330,"height":245,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"left-delay","type":"text","text":"## Left alignment · planned\n\nDelay L[x] + valid/x one edge to match cache.","x":845,"y":155,"width":335,"height":245,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"right-cache","type":"text","text":"## Right-column cache · planned\n\nShift WHOLE vertical columns: Q[0]=R[x], Q[d]=R[x−d] for d<D_MAX. Hold on invalid cycles; restart at output-row boundary.","x":845,"y":525,"width":335,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"taps","type":"text","text":"## Direct disparity wires · planned\n\nFor the shown 32-lane bank, Q[d] wires straight to engine d: no mux or extra register. A smaller reused bank needs group-base selection. Valid only when x≥d.","x":1275,"y":525,"width":400,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"pairs","type":"text","text":"## To engine d\n\nPair delayed L[x] with R[x−d], plus valid_d and x/row identity. Replicate per disparity.\n[[Accelerator Blocks.canvas|Back to accelerator]]","x":1855,"y":305,"width":390,"height":265,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"frontend-note","type":"text","text":"## Why this order?\n\nRow buffers collect pixels VERTICALLY. Disparity shifts columns HORIZONTALLY, *after* row buffering. Example: x=6,d=2 → L[6] vs R[4]. The cache is not the engine’s horizontal SAD-cost history.","x":520,"y":1030,"width":1135,"height":195,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"source","type":"text","text":"## Paired pixel streams\n\nSame pixel coordinate and valid on both inputs.","x":-280,"y":308,"width":270,"height":185,"color":"6"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"left-pixels","fromNode":"source","fromSide":"right","toNode":"left-row","toSide":"left","label":"left pixel + valid"},
		{"id":"right-pixels","fromNode":"source","fromSide":"right","toNode":"right-row","toSide":"left","label":"right pixel + same valid"},
		{"id":"left-sync","fromNode":"left-row","fromSide":"right","toNode":"left-delay","toSide":"left","label":"L[x] + valid + x"},
